OL,5,G2000 WWII Battles in Colour
OL,6,     FJuly 1943. The German advance has
OL,7,     Fstalled, but Hitler is convinced
OL,8,     Fhis new generation of tanks will
OL,9,     Fput the Reich back on the path to
OL,10,     Fdomination. His target: the Soviet
OL,11,     Ftown of Kursk. (Ep4)
OL,12,G2100 The Lancaster Bomber
