OL,14,     Fmost iconic aircraft was built and
OL,15,     Fbecame Bomber Command's most
OL,16,     Fdestructive weapon, playing a key
OL,17,     Frole in defeating Nazi Germany in
OL,18,     FWWII. (1/1)
