OL,5,G0015 Prisoner: Cell Block H
OL,6,     FSean McNally cuts Toni off,
OL,7,     Frefusing to supply her with any
OL,8,     Fmore contraband. Glenys, the
OL,9,     Fwitness to Toni's crime, is
OL,10,     Ffollowed around by McNally's
OL,11,     Fhitmen.
OL,12,G0115 Prisoner: Cell Block H
OL,13,     FBea realises Toni is dealing drugs
OL,14,     Fand hits Doreen for going along
OL,15,     Fwith her. Karen's childish
OL,16,     Fbehaviour earns her a telling off
OL,17,     Ffrom a furious Angela, and Mum
OL,18,     Fcollapses at home alone.
